pen_pr", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-fin-212-bankers-rounding", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 379011, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_018pjwSrPfGUzBhyC7EsJLLU", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 382695, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug on a new branch, CI passed, and I opened PR #101 against main with alex as reviewer.\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` rounded halves up (`ROUND_HALF_UP`), even though its docstring says it uses banker's rounding (FIN-212). That's why `tests/test_money.py` failed on 2.665: it should round to 2.66, but the code gave 2.67.\n- **Fix:** On branch `fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding`, I changed it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. Nothing else changed.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on commit 08d3cd5986.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nI haven't merged it. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01MspnjVtfwGrGafUJrfYCyE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01JBfHyDsVmqv4TZKgwz266D", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01RAsfqkeg5e1eXki3b92bRT", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_files", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Pbzh2SDd5u4zULBeSxD3we", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_0182CyN