ves up (`ROUND_HALF_UP`), even though its docstring says it uses banker's rounding (FIN-212). That's why `tests/test_money.py` failed on 2.665: it should round to 2.66, but the code gave 2.67.\n- **Fix:** On branch `fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding`, I changed it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. Nothing else changed.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on commit 08d3cd5986.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nI haven't merged it. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner.", "type": "text"}]}]}